From f22544c0ba3bea84ae85b2ed663c07b21188f0fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunwenxiang <sunwenxiang133@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:43:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add sophgo custom features to webui-vue

- Use aspeed's novnc fork (jpg support) with webpack4 config
- sophgo icons (sg2042 header logo, sophgo login logo), prettier off
- CPLD info (CPUA/CPUB/CPUO/Other/PSU/EFuse power states) on power page
- CPLD firmware card on Firmware page
- SOL port switching (CPU0/CPU1 UART0/UART1) + SOL log export
- Inventory: hide DIMM/fans/PSU/assembly tables
- Fan speed control page (Settings > Fan speed)
- Network: DHCP enable switch
- 1684x board temperature display on Sensors page

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [sophgo specific]
